        <h2>Summary</h2>

<p>This PR adds unit tests for the Calculator utility class.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>

<ul>
<li>Add test file for Calculator class</li>
<li>Test basic arithmetic operations (add, subtract, multiply, divide)</li>
<li>Test error handling for division by zero</li>
<li>Test async operations</li>
<li>Test history tracking feature</li>
<li>Test reset functionality</li>
</ul>

<h2>Testing</h2>

<p>Run tests with:</p>

<pre><code class="language-bash">npm test -- --testPathPattern=calculator
</code></pre>

<h2>Checklist</h2>

<ul>
<li>[x] Tests pass locally</li>
<li>[x] Code follows project style guidelines</li>
<li>[x] Documentation updated if needed</li>
