<p>This PR adds comprehensive unit tests for the Calculator utility class. The test coverage is good, with tests for basic operations, error handling, and async functionality.</p>

<h3>Strengths</h3>

<ul>
<li>Clean test structure using describe/test blocks</li>
<li>Good use of beforeEach/afterEach for setup and teardown</li>
<li>Controllable promise pattern for async testing</li>
</ul>

<h3>Areas for Improvement</h3>

<ul>
<li>Consider adding boundary value tests</li>
<li>Add tests for concurrent operations</li>
<li>Consider memory management for history feature</li>
</ul>

